{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-42","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与给定三角形等面积的平行四边形","englishTitle":"To construct, in a given rectilineal angle, a parallelogram equal to a given triangle.","book":1,"number":42,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.42","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.42/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":42,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-42@raw-30b672cb28241e19","contentId":"euclid-1-42","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"30b672cb28241e1906e317cdb7712cbe82eec9793648f9578671877a29e1237b","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-42.statement","euclid-1-42.construction.1","euclid-1-42.construction.2","euclid-1-42.proof.1","euclid-1-42.proof.2","euclid-1-42.proof.3","euclid-1-42.proof.4","euclid-1-42.conclusion","euclid-1-42.historical.1","euclid-1-42.historical.2","euclid-1-42.historical.3","euclid-1-42.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-42.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-42","revisionId":"euclid-1-42@raw-30b672cb28241e19","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6097e6549cf2aa5adc0d9f9102e64151c904e09a39b13abaf514bd6a97b65a34","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To construct, in a given rectilineal angle, a parallelogram equal to a given triangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"要在给定的直角上构造一个平行四边形 等于给定三角形的三角形。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有三角形求作平行方形与之等而方形角有与所设角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于三角形，找到与之相等的平行四边形，正方形具有设定角相等的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-42.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-42","revisionId":"euclid-1-42@raw-30b672cb28241e19","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"36d895f2371cde80865c46d02a43cd0092dec0c6cd8f3d9ec690bea5c0ba789d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be the given triangle, and D the given rectilineal angle; thus it is required to construct in the rectilineal angle D a parallelogram equal to the triangle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC是给定三角形,让D是给定直角;因此,需要在直角D和平行四边形之间构造一个直角,等于三角形ABC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-42.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-42","revisionId":"euclid-1-42@raw-30b672cb28241e19","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fd308191d1887c133130904cbb30b79a7613dd2171260496f86880370d25ada3","citations":["euclid-1-23","euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let BC be bisected at E, and let AE be joined; on the straight line EC, and at the point E on it, let the angle CEF be constructed equal to the angle D; [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)] through A let AG be drawn parallel to EC, and [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)] through C let CG be drawn parallel to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让BC在E线上两分为二,并让AE线合起来;在EC线上,让CEF角等于D角;在A线上,让AG角与EC线平行;在C线上,让CG线等于EF线。 [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-42.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-42","revisionId":"euclid-1-42@raw-30b672cb28241e19","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"95fd5f71f791281be718c0e8f2bf83b50d2884d9cfa839fa3ee95b64753f33b0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then FECG is a parallelogram."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FECG是平行四边形"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-42.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-42","revisionId":"euclid-1-42@raw-30b672cb28241e19","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a0e72a7e7a6132717bf2703db8c9e050c59d3b777a8f320b70582fd29a71b1b8","citations":["euclid-1-38"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BE is equal to EC, the triangle ABE is also equal to the triangle AEC, for they are on equal bases BE, EC and in the same parallels BC, AG; [[I. 38](/principles/euclid-1-38)] therefore the triangle ABC is double of the triangle AEC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于BE等于EC,三角ABE也等于三角AEC, 因为它们等于底边 BE, EC, 并同时是BC, AG; 因此三角ABC是三角AEC的两倍。 [[I. 38](/principles/euclid-1-38)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-42.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-42","revisionId":"euclid-1-42@raw-30b672cb28241e19","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ebaf45cefd6f33cb2b9bab2755e9f7528e7c4b9b43e559e7add2cc7eac096d5","citations":["euclid-1-41"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the parallelogram FECG is also double of the triangle AEC, for it has the same base with it and is in the same parallels with it; [[I. 41](/principles/euclid-1-41)] therefore the parallelogram FECG is equal to the triangle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是平行四边形 FECG是三角形AEC的两倍,因为它与三角形底边相同,并且与三角形相同;因此,平行四边形 FECG等于三角形ABC。 [[I. 41](/principles/euclid-1-41)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-42.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-42","revisionId":"euclid-1-42@raw-30b672cb28241e19","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7d26ef492a2039c76ac8d732f43853d5148533fc12580f6da557d3625a8d1795","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it has the angle CEF equal to the given angle D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其角度是CEF等于给定角度D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-42.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-42","revisionId":"euclid-1-42@raw-30b672cb28241e19","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"580f4ff7658a6756f91fc07f76db9530d462d5ba049694eb6b9745181e8679d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the parallelogram FECG has been constructed equal to the given triangle ABC, in the angle CEF which is equal to D. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,平行四边形 FECG三角形的构造等于给定的三角形ABC,角度CEF,等于D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-42.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-42","revisionId":"euclid-1-42@raw-30b672cb28241e19","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e24aa1042a68eeab6cb98846ab60f3d47f560128b28e040444e4d1c9cfea9e2f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有三角形求作平行方形与之等而方形角有与所设角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于三角形，找到与之相等的平行四边形，正方形具有设定角相等的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-42.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-42","revisionId":"euclid-1-42@raw-30b672cb28241e19","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6bc11ac554ef9807501f5a10e80dbbdd30301c8b78bfa88dbc118056a4f24d1e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：设甲乙丙角形丁角求作平行方形与甲乙丙角形等而有丁角先分一边为两平分如乙丙边平分于戊〈本篇十〉次作丙戊己角与丁角等〈本篇廿〉次自甲作直线与乙丙平行〈本篇卅一〉而与戊己线遇于己末自丙作直线与戊己平行为丙庚〈本篇卅一〉而与甲己线遇于庚则得己戊丙庚平行方形与甲乙丙角形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘图方法如下：构造三角形 甲乙丙，并构造 丁 作为与三角形 甲乙丙 相等的平行四边形。已知角 丁，首先将一条边进行平分，称为二等分。例如，边 乙丙 在 戊〈本篇十〉 处分为两半，然后画出 丙戊己 和 丁 作为等角。然后从 甲 绘制与 乙丙 平行的直线至 〈本篇廿〉，〈本篇卅一〉 与线 戊己 在 己 结束交汇。在 己 末端，从 丙 画一条与 戊己 平行的线至 丙庚〈本篇卅一〉，并在 庚 处与 甲己 相交，然后是 己戊丙庚 平行四边形和 甲乙丙 三角形，相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-42.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-42","revisionId":"euclid-1-42@raw-30b672cb28241e19","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a0cfc05f283d3ea24d82f06d5783225065bec1cb47280add8bc20ad918a8091e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试自甲至戊作直线其甲戊丙角形与己戊丙庚平行方形在两平行线内同底则己戊丙庚倍大于甲戊丙矣〈本篇四一〉夫甲乙丙亦倍大于甲戊丙〈本篇卅八〉〈増〉即与己戊丙庚等〈公论六〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：从 甲 绘制一条直线到 戊。如果三角形 甲戊丙 和平行四边形 己戊丙庚 在两条平行线之间拥有相同的底边，那么 己戊丙庚 大于 甲戊丙，〈本篇四一〉 和 甲乙丙 也大于 甲戊丙〈本篇卅八〉〈増〉，即 己戊丙庚 和 〈公论六〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-42.source","contentId":"euclid-1-42","revisionId":"euclid-1-42@raw-30b672cb28241e19","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a9a1ca78a48c4adea9aebd823d685821a4eb96582de0c00b42613a383dc14970","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-en